    {
      "doc_required": true,
      "example": "a.www.example.com",
      "help_en": "For example, if you set SubDomain to a.www.example.com:\n\nIf you do not specify DomainName, the system queries the DNS records for the hostname a.www of the domain name example.com.\n\nIf you set DomainName to www.example.com, the system queries the DNS records for the hostname a of the domain name www.example.com.\n\nIf you set DomainName to \"a.www.example.com\", the system queries the DNS records for the hostname @ of the domain name a.www.example.com",
      "help_zh": "`例如参数SubDomain为\"a.www.example.com\"为例：`\n\n`如果参数DomainName为空，则查询域名为example.com、主机名为”a.www“的解析记录。`\n`如果参数DomainName为\"www.example.com\"，则查询域名为\"www.example.com\"、主机名为\"a\"的解析记录。`\n`如果参数DomainName为\"a.www.example.com\"，则查询域名为\"a.www.example.com\"、主机名为\"@\"的解析记录。`",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "sub_domain",
      "options": [
        "--sub-domain"
      ],
      "raw_name": "SubDomain",
      "required": true,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "1",
      "help_en": "The page number. The value starts from 1. Default value: 1",
      "help_zh": "当前页数，起始值为1，默认为1",
      "location": "query",
      "minimum": "1",
      "name": "page_number",
      "options": [
        "--page-number"
      ],
      "raw_name": "PageNumber",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "example": "20",
      "help_en": "The number of entries to return on each page. Maximum value: 100. Default value: 20",
      "help_zh": "分页查询时设置的每页行数，最大值100，默认为20",
      "location": "query",
      "maximum": "500",
      "minimum": "1",
      "name": "page_size",
      "options": [
        "--page-size"
      ],
      "raw_name": "PageSize",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "example": "MX",
      "help_en": "The type of the DNS record. If you do not specify this parameter, all types of DNS records for the subdomain are returned.\n\nThe record types are case-insensitive and include the following: A, MX, CNAME, TXT, REDIRECT_URL, FORWARD_URL, NS, AAAA, and SRV",
      "help_zh": "解析记录类型。若不传值，则返回子域名对应的全部解析记录类型。\n\n解析类型包括(不区分大小写)：A、MX、CNAME、TXT、REDIRECT_URL、FORWORD_URL、NS、AAAA、SRV",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "type",
      "options": [
        "--type"
